sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor O as Owner
    participant H as Control loop
    participant S1 as System One
    participant DB as Oracle AI Database
    participant S2 as Claude
    participant M as MCP servers
    O->>H: Time-block my top three tasks
    H->>S1: Which procedure? Which tools?
    S1-->>H: A probability for each
    H->>DB: Memory, governed meanings
    DB-->>H: Context for this turn
    H->>S2: Context and the chosen tools
    S2-->>H: Call plan_day, then create three events
    H->>M: Read the calendar
    M-->>H: Events, marked as external data
    H->>DB: Write the audit rows, save a checkpoint
    H-->>O: Approve these three events?
    O->>H: Approved
    H->>M: Create the events
    H->>DB: Record the outcome and the episode
    H-->>O: Your afternoon is blocked
